{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20467","headline":"和左司元郎中秋居十首 八 · 张籍","name":"和左司元郎中秋居十首 八","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"菊地才通履，茶房不垒阶。\n凭医看蜀药，寄信觅吴鞋。\n尽得仙家法，多随道客斋。\n本无荣辱意，不是学安排。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张籍","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20467.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20467","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}